package dev.cajeta.ml;

/**
 * Concrete holder for one bagging member. Exists because the ensemble's
 * members ride in an `ArrayList` — and an interface-typed element fetched
 * from a generic container currently trips the open
 * `iface-downcast-generic-call` toolchain defect when a generic-returning
 * method (`predict`) is called through it. A concrete element type with an
 * interface FIELD is the proven shape ({@link Pipeline} stores its stages
 * exactly so); collapse this back to `ArrayList<Predictor>` when the INDEX
 * row closes.
 */
final class BagMember {
    Predictor est;

    BagMember(#Predictor est) {
        this.est #= est;
        return;
    }
}
